{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/6iqzub","slideIndex":1,"text":"We begin with the robot facing a single block. The program approaches it, then tracks the block from the start of the push. The stop decision comes from the measured change in block position rather than the driver command duration.\n\n中文提示：单块测试先把车头对准方块。接近后以方块起始位置作基准，一边短动一边读新画面，达到 100 毫米目标就停车。\n\nSource: control/单块自主推送测试说明.md; control/single_push_control.py"}
