{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/3823bn","slideIndex":3,"text":"The software test completed two successive deliveries and ended with a stop. The physical attempt on 10 November did not start: the camera marked some long or merged areas as blocks. The controller kept the robot stopped, so the run did not verify any delivery.\n\n中文提示：软件联调完成两块入黄区并最终停车。但 11 月 10 日那次现场没有启动：中线长条和粘连区域形成了过大的框，程序停车等待，记录的完成数是零。\n\nSource: tmp/reconnect-multi-check.log; vision/results/multi-push-20261110-174035-836654/events.jsonl; 10 Nov live screenshot."}
